# Normalize to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Two artifacts in this repo are compared byte-for-byte by tests/run_tests.py:
#   vgp/schema.json          vs  skill/assets/vgp-0.1.schema.json
#   webmcp/giving-tools.js   vs  a fresh generate_webmcp.py run
# Letting core.autocrlf decide line endings makes those comparisons depend on
# the checkout platform. Pin them instead.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
